{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238810/extras/21b5995f6b53fd8eb885f33f9f615c06.webp?t=1758061527\" width=620 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238810/extras/1367890b01be67c93087a093d820f652.poster.avif?t=1758061527\" width=534 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238810/extras/1367890b01be67c93087a093d820f652.webm?t=1758061527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238810/extras/1367890b01be67c93087a093d820f652.mp4?t=1758061527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;9 lives 9 Millimeters&quot; is a single or multi-player tower defense game where the player(s) mix and match weapons, appliances, food, and cat cards to serve customers and take out vermin. Players must defend their territory and their pizza from bugs that evolve over time and keep the customers happy. Players must rethink their strategy as the game progresses and upgrade their cats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238810/extras/8bd885a51339319113974bc1dfe8264a.poster.avif?t=1758061527\" width=356 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238810/extras/8bd885a51339319113974bc1dfe8264a.webm?t=1758061527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238810/extras/8bd885a51339319113974bc1dfe8264a.mp4?t=1758061527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238810/extras/c16d04e1fad50fad8a7cb251488205c8.avif?t=1758061527\" width=1094 height=403 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch cats and combine cards to create new towers such as lions. Develop the cats to sniper kitties and other advanced weaponry to stop the brutal onslaught of these bugs from encroaching on the cafe and from stealing the cat wheels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238810/extras/4b8d53c2325d09639fed658dbd63dca3.poster.avif?t=1758061527\" width=636 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238810/extras/4b8d53c2325d09639fed658dbd63dca3.webm?t=1758061527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238810/extras/4b8d53c2325d09639fed658dbd63dca3.mp4?t=1758061527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > At the same time, don't let the customers see the bugs. Craft their meals and make money. Did the customers see the bugs or are they unhappy with their meals? Too bad, no money. Satisfy customers and murder bugs to buy cards, build refrigerators, store things in refrigerators (even between players), and upgrade towers to crush this menace to society. How many nights can the player(s) survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradable units such as cats, refrigerators, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable loadouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy card packs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine cards for surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide variety of cats and weapons</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's cats vs. bugs and your nine lives are running out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238810/extras/21b5995f6b53fd8eb885f33f9f615c06.webp?t=1758061527\" width=620 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3238810?t=1758061527","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238810/fd724ade32b1a41efc9a4ccbae1d42b42f5b1f59/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758061527","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238810/00aa520024e4fa7d68ec587b7ff5a28aabf16a6f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758061527","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238810/00aa520024e4fa7d68ec587b7ff5a28aabf16a6f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758061527","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238810/extras/21b5995f6b53fd8eb885f33f9f615c06.webp?t=1758061527\" width=620 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autopla